    "title": "Nearly 6 months after fatal Asheville apartment shooting, family still seeks answers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gracie Palmer ,\n7 hours ago ASHEVILLE, N.C. (WLOS) — Nearly six months after 27-year-old Eric Lee Anderson Lordman Jr. was shot and killed at Pisgah View Apartments, his family is still searching for answers as the Asheville Police Department continues investigating the case. Lordman was found dead from multiple gunshot wounds near Granada Street... Read full article",
